WEBVTT

00:06:58.456 --> 00:07:01.041
plan the events, recruit the talent.

00:07:01.459 --> 00:07:03.627
The question should not merely be,

00:07:03.669 --> 00:07:06.505
"What can I do to help
address the climate crisis?"

00:07:06.547 --> 00:07:09.341
But, "What can we do together?"

00:07:09.341 --> 00:07:10.718
Join something.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.305
And if you need a bit of inspiration,

00:07:14.305 --> 00:07:18.893
here is a list of some
climate solutions to consider.

00:07:19.894 --> 00:07:23.230
So what will you do?
Or how will you step it up?

00:07:23.439 --> 00:07:24.773
Actually draw this out.

00:07:25.065 --> 00:07:28.152
What are you good at?
What is the work that needs doing?

00:07:28.486 --> 00:07:29.778
And what brings you joy?